    - rid: 3046478936985567327
  allNodes:
  - dialogueText: Greetings! Welcome the our hotel, what can I do for you?
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389253
    - rid: 6774952781063389258
    - rid: 6774952781063389268
    - rid: 6774952781063389292
    isRootNode: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 276, y: 166}
    guid:
      Part1: 801923639
      Part2: 1285914272
      Part3: 169959312
      Part4: 2761389138
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: Thats odd... There's not much stuff to do around here
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389257
    - rid: 6774952781063389284
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1253, y: -408.24}
    guid:
      Part1: 2982223139
      Part2: 1084376014
      Part3: 4077460102
      Part4: 2544384999
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Fantastic! You can find your very own room number 2 upstairs,
      quite near our beautiful, temporarelly in reparations, sauna!

      Dinner
      will be served at 7pm'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389260
    - rid: 6774952781063389261
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1253, y: -51.23999}
    guid:
      Part1: 4028658863
      Part2: 1280522940
      Part3: 2166873217
      Part4: 985772993
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: "Oh, a few guests went in and decided to have too much fun! Ha-ha!
      \nDon't worry, they won't be invited again. We'll repair it as soon as we find
      the keys"
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389265
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2591, y: 152.76001}
    guid:
      Part1: 1012819177
      Part2: 1162638506
      Part3: 3147358645
      Part4: 705986296
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: I bet you'll be delighted. Our chef, Andrey, is such a fantastic
      cook, I just hope the pressure doesn't... agitate him...
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389264
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2591, y: -51.23999}
    guid:
      Part1: 3035836761
      Part2: 1265355892
      Part3: 2035803023
      Part4: 4244752949
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Oh you haven''t heard? We have some top tier guests this evening!

      Oleg,
      a politician in the midst of his campaign and Aleksei, a once quite popular
      artist'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389267
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3681, y: -408.24}
    guid:
      Part1: 722697724
      Part2: 1280739601
      Part3: 1576957063
      Part4: 1757867502
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Right! He''s this pretty famous artist.

      Or at least he
      was...

      Now that I think of it I haven''t heard of any new paintings
      of his in a while.

      Maybe he got demotivated after that publication'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389286
    - rid: 6774952781063389287
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1179, y: 356.99997}
    guid:
      Part1: 2555944989
      Part2: 1144976354
      Part3: 2709672358
      Part4: 1246743225
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Well, yes! But as of late the hotel has been getting more guests
      than usual!

      And by "as of late" I do mean today...

      And by "usual"
      I do mean zero...'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses: []
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2260.996, y: -407.99994}
    guid:
      Part1: 3514762631
      Part2: 1103566297
      Part3: 3602503331
      Part4: 1515332628
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: Oh, I'd just hate to gossip!
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389288
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1962, y: 357}
    guid:
      Part1: 2145143534
      Part2: 1212596299
      Part3: 2942565505
      Part4: 1884612623
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Ok, fine I''ll tell you!

      Some reporter started spreading
      rumores about him being a sexual deviant! Gasp!

      And a homosexual one
      at that!'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389293
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2456, y: 357}
    guid:
      Part1: 3269285805
      Part2: 1082998990
      Part3: 3938144144
      Part4: 2440207961
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Not that I''ve heard, and you know how much I hate to gossip.

      Why''d
      you say so?'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389294
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2062, y: 567}
    guid:
      Part1: 1835650083
      Part2: 1116989002
      Part3: 330040960
      Part4: 909379228
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Oh let me guess, Oleg is jelous that Aleksei is getting the largest
      room, right?

      I knew it, I knew it, I knew it!

      I knew I had to
      find a way to make Aleksei liberate that room, there are hirearchies, you know?

      What
      will people say about my hotel if I can''t even give the best room to my most
      distinguished guest!'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389295
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2919, y: 567}
    guid:
      Part1: 1748450147
      Part2: 1172831568
      Part3: 623996333
      Part4: 1959634253
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Normally I would deny entry to such queer folk

      But, you
      have admit, the man is talented

      Oh how I dream of him making a painting
      with this hotel for all the world to see...'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389296
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3244, y: 357}
    guid:
      Part1: 3588371253
      Part2: 1297772373
      Part3: 2993961088
      Part4: 2788573545
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Haven''t you heard?

      He''s this up and coming politician,
      quite the contentious person'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389303
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1211.2875, y: 771}
    guid:
      Part1: 221279732
      Part2: 1220487631
      Part3: 2312350385
      Part4: 2414502260
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Yeah, I''m not one to gossip, but it seems the governent isn''t
      very fond of him.

      As for me, I quite like having a prestigue guest,
      I wonder what made him choose us...'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389316
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1924, y: 771}
    guid:
      Part1: 1928340226
      Part2: 1170109666
      Part3: 1316327562
      Part4: 260398614
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Oh, I''m so glad to hear!

      You know, Andrey hasn''t been
      feeling the best lately and that news would really cheer him up.

      Would
      you mind telling him?'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389318
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1204, y: 1048}
    guid:
      Part1: 308867213
      Part2: 1320209817
      Part3: 3588333485
      Part4: 1335350961
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'There, I''ve opened up the kitchen.

      Go right ahead and
      tell him.'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 1
    responses: []
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2048, y: 1048}
    guid:
      Part1: 2583858688
      Part2: 1244362920
      Part3: 3981891749
      Part4: 731673015
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Oh you haven''t heard? We have some top tier guests this evening!

      Oleg,
      a politician in the midst of his campaign and Aleksei, a once quite popular
      artist.'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 1630672535616487501
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3658, y: -50}
    guid:
      Part1: 2805659445
      Part2: 1183585811
      Part3: 1197842849
      Part4: 3398019176
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Well, yes! But as of late the hotel has been getting more guests
      than usual!

      And by "as of late" I do mean today...

      And by "usual"
      I do mean zero...

      But I knew this would all turn around one day! And
      now we''ve got some real VIP guests blessing us with their presence.'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567307
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2388, y: -153.99998}
    guid:
      Part1: 1905733868
      Part2: 1129004607
      Part3: 2633351612
      Part4: 1809174617
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Oh you haven''t heard? We have some top tier guests this evening!

      Oleg,
      a politician in the midst of his campaign and Aleksei, a once quite popular
      artist.'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567308
    - rid: 3046478936985567309
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3475.2947, y: -154}
    guid:
      Part1: 4209125068
      Part2: 1305821517
      Part3: 2972826264
      Part4: 2031857102
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Right! He''s this pretty famous artist.

      Or at least he
      was...

      Now that I think of it I haven''t heard of any new paintings
      of his in a while.

      I''m not one to gossip, but maybe he got demotivated
      after that one article...'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567310
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4447.0376, y: -329.00003}
    guid:
      Part1: 1261033585
      Part2: 1109877559
      Part3: 523396775
      Part4: 3925866868
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'He''s this up and coming politician, quite the contentious person.
      I''m not one to gossip, but it seems the governent isn''t very fond of him.

      Either
      way, as far as I''m concerned, I quite like having such a prestigious guest.
      I wonder what made him choose us...'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567311
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4433, y: -41.626137}
    guid:
      Part1: 1084635640
      Part2: 1239400926
      Part3: 3848048305
      Part4: 891342165
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'You see, some journalist once accused him of being a... deviant,
      if you get what I''m saying.

      Normally I would deny entry to such queer
      folk but... you have to admit, the man is talented.

      Oh, how I dream
      of him making a painting with this hotel for all the world to see...!'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567312
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 5259, y: -329}
    guid:
      Part1: 3281136560
      Part2: 1341605581
      Part3: 2692599953
      Part4: 2335719801
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Not as far as I''ve heard... though you know how much I hate to
      gossip.

      Why? Do you, perhaps... know who it was?'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567313
    - rid: 3046478936985567314
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 6347.8516, y: -334.00006}
    guid:
      Part1: 171815091
      Part2: 1122010975
      Part3: 4256102025
      Part4: 267813150
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Oh, let me guess, you say that because Oleg is jealous that Aleksei
      is getting the largest room, right?

      I knew it, I knew it, I knew it!

      I
      knew I had to find a way to make Aleksei liberate that room: priorities are
      priorities, you know?

      What will people say about my hotel if I can''t
      even give the best room to my most <b>distinguished</b> guest!'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567315
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 7287.587, y: -251}
    guid:
      Part1: 2642126672
      Part2: 1264286908
      Part3: 2451570350
      Part4: 3378827760
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
  - dialogueText: 'Well, she IS a reporter, and she casually seems to be in a place
      full of celebrities, so... I guess that is not a bad theory is it?

      Then
      again, she seems a bit too... serious to be going around besmirching the name
      of random artists.

      If she''s here for a reason, I bet it must be something
      far more important than that... and in my hotel... Oh, my, I think I might
      faint...'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567316
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 7261, y: -464}
    guid:
      Part1: 2923304815
      Part2: 1273307586
      Part3: 3503069355
      Part4: 2428477677
    tag: 
    altDialoguePaths: []
